  "terminal_reviews": [],
  "notes": "Nintendo’s official title page identifies itself as Fire Emblem: Three Houses and names Jeralt plus these students as story characters in their respective houses. The exact campaign keys correspond to the named characters in the publisher guide: Jeralt, Edelgard, Petra, Ferdinand, Linhardt, Dimitri, Dedue, Felix, Ashe, Sylvain, Mercedes, Annette, Ingrid, Claude, Lorenz, Raphael, Ignatz, Lysithea, Marianne, Hilda, and Leonie. This is direct title character evidence; no relationship is inferred from house membership."
